<title>LATVIA: Yields fall further on Latvian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Yields fall further on Latvian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on Latvian government Treasury bills fell further at auction on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AVG YLD (PCT) AVG LAST WEEK  ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One-month     9.97	    10.17	   1.0   2.59  1.0</p>
<p> Three-month   10.42	   10.65	   1.25  3.0   1.25</p>
<p> Six-month     11.93	   12.00	   2.50  6.1   2.50</p>
<p> One-year	12.85	   12.96	   1.25  2.12  1.25</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
